{"id":"455081","name":"鱼头煮红薯粉丝","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/455081/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鱼头","amount":"一个"},{"name":"红薯粉丝","amount":"适量"},{"name":"米椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"米酒","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好鱼头和红薯粉丝。","img":"images/455081/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"粉丝用温水泡发。","img":"images/455081/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"起锅烧油，油里放一点点盐。","img":"images/455081/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"油七成热时，下鱼头煎。","img":"images/455081/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"翻面，加姜粒煎出香味，加米酒去腥。","img":"images/455081/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加米椒粒，倒入开水小火熬煮鱼头二十分钟。","img":"images/455081/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加粉丝稍煮两分钟。","img":"images/455081/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加盐、鸡精、胡椒粉调味，加葱花。","img":"images/455081/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"起锅。","img":"images/455081/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"鲜美。","img":"images/455081/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"开吃了。","img":"images/455081/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}